_004","text":"Lab Report: Image classification experiments","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s1","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s2","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.0003 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s3","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"All experiments were run on a single GPU with 12 GB of memory.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s4","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"Figure 1 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s5","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"EfficientNet achieves 91.7% validation accuracy on MNIST (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s6","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"On MNIST, EfficientNet is about 4 points better than VGG-16.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s7","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"EfficientNet outperforms ViT-S by 6.2 percentage points on CIFAR-10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s8","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"Figure 2 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s9","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"At epoch 6, Ours is 3.8 points better than Baseline.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s10","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"From epoch 4 to epoch 7, the accuracy of Ours improves by a relative 5.8%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s11","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"As shown in Figure 2, from epoch 2 to epoch 7, the accuracy of Ours improves by a relative 35.0%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s12","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"As shown in Figure 2, from epoch 4 to epoch 6, the accuracy of Ours improves by a relative","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s13","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s14","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"Figure 3 shows the accuracy by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s15","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"MLP outperforms EfficientNet by 2.9 percentage points on Fashion-MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s16","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"On CIFAR-10, EfficientNet obtains a accuracy of 61.7%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s17","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"As shown in Figure 3, MLP achieves 54.8% accuracy on Fashion-MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s18","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"MLP achieves over 60% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s19","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"Figure 4 shows the test accuracy of CNN by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s20","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"On IMDB, CNN obtains a test accuracy of 50.6% (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s21","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"CNN scores 43.4 points higher on Fashion-MNIST than on IMDB.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s22","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"CNN scores 5.3 points higher on SVHN than on IMDB (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_004_s23","report_id":"calib_easy_004","text":"On SVHN, Random Forest obtains an accuracy of 90.7%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}